      Disclaimer: Results are engineering and financial estimates for educational planning only—not formal contractor bids, utility tariff guarantees, or tax advice. Confirm site shading (PVWatts/helioscope), local utility interconnection tariffs, and tax eligibility with a licensed installer and CPA.
    </p>
  </section>

